{
  "tema": 9256,
  "slug": "subjuntivo-presente-dormir-morir",
  "titulo": "Conjugate dormir and morir in the present subjunctive (o > u in nosotros)",
  "subtitulo": "Duerma, durmamos: in nosotros, the o turns into u.",
  "foto": "t08.jpg",
  "regla": "Dormir and morir change o > ue in the subjunctive, and in nosotros o > u: duerma, duermas, durmamos, duerman.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Normally, stem-changing verbs keep the infinitive's vowel in **nosotros** in the present subjunctive (**volvamos**, **soñemos**). **Dormir** (_to sleep_) and **morir** (_to die_) don't follow that rule: in **nosotros**, the **o** becomes **u**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "dormir",
            "morir"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "duerma",
              "muera"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "duermas",
              "mueras"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "duerma",
              "muera"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "durmamos",
              "muramos"
            ],
            [
              "ustedes, ellos",
              "duerman",
              "mueran"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "So the pattern is **ue** in every form, and **u** in **nosotros**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: even asleep, **nosotros** turns over: from **o** to **u**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "No creo que ==durmamos== en este hotel esta noche.",
              "en": "I don't think we'll sleep in this hotel tonight."
            },
            {
              "es": "Es poco probable que nos ==muramos== de sed.",
              "en": "It's unlikely we'll die of thirst."
            },
            {
              "es": "Dudo que ==durmamos== más de cuatro horas.",
              "en": "I doubt we'll sleep more than four hours."
            },
            {
              "es": "¡Abre la ventana! ¿Quieres que nos ==muramos== de calor?",
              "en": "Open the window! Do you want us to die of heat?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Quiero que ==duermas== bien antes del torneo.",
              "en": "I want you to sleep well before the tournament."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
